      "value": "@{5fcabd718203f619fde219f4|full_name}: The tags do absolutely nothing at the moment. Just because a game is not made to be something doesn't mean it doesn't evolve to be something else, and the creators must then adapt to that or push to completely remove it if they want it to be as it was originally intended.\nThat is why platforms like youtube actually look into situations and fix problems that could get creators videos taken down and striked like markiplier and moist for reasons unknown/unneeded and update their policy's frequently to adapt to the ever so expanding and evolving space that is youtube.\nRight now it is what it is which includes a lot of lewd and them sticking with their outdated TOS and banning people for causes that could be fixed and handled otherwise is unneeded. This is an easy fix that everyone can appreciate, even unlewd people as they could have the option to hide it all when right now there is none other than hiding it after it's too late. Also this gives users an actual reason to mark their avatars as NSFW as most people do not mark that when uploading their avatars even when it is, as there is no benefit in doing it right now.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
